  "methodology": "Manually curated two-member lowercase ASCII classes for a transparent toy watermark. A pair is only eligible in corpus sentences where both variants preserve the intended meaning; every marked corpus variant requires manual review. Version 2 widens the list so that a meaningful share of ordinary words becomes eligible, which raises the density of the signal and therefore the statistical power of the check.",
